<title>UK: RUGBY UNION-LLANELLI BEAT WESTERN SAMOA 23-15.</title>
<headline>RUGBY UNION-LLANELLI BEAT WESTERN SAMOA 23-15.</headline>
<dateline>LLANELLI, Wales 1996-11-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Llanelli beat Western Samoa 23-15 (halftime 15-8) in a rugby union tour match on Saturday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Llanelli - Tries: Ricky Evans, Garan Evans (2). Conversion: Frano Botica. Penalties: Botica (2)</p>
<p>Western Samoa - Tries: Junior Paramore, Afato Sooalo.</p>
<p>Conversion: Earl Va'a. Penalty: Earl Va'a.</p>
